==English==

===Noun===
Zoroastrianism
# The ancient religion of Iran (persia) and also a mother-religion to all other abrahamic religions founded and reformed by Zoroaster (1000 or 1100 BC), which teaches the worship of one god, ultimate good, Ahura Mazda, who is the only creator of the world and all the good things, and despise the ultimate evil ,Ahriman.
